<title>
<![CDATA[ Troll Farms, AI, and the Engineering of Public Opinion ]]>
</title>
<description>
<![CDATA[ A few months ago, I wrote about the “Manufactured Web,” focusing mainly on bought reviews. Fake five-star ratings. Reputation padding. Synthetic trust signals. But a recent MSSP podcast episode pushed ]]>
</description>
